    {
        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14656\">PR #14656</a> from <code>xia-chao:fix/wasi-http-trailers-body-error</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The contract makes this future the place for \"trailers received, or an error\", but on a body error it reports \"no trailers\".<br>\nThis PR sends the error into that future, and adds a test.<br>\nHere I choose to leave the real error to the read path; what goes to the future is a synthesized <code>Error::HttpProtocolError</code>, because that keeps the change surface smallest. But the real error could also be sent to the future as a whole, with the read path changed to return the category error.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
