    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14656#discussion_r4249884958\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"suggestion\"><pre><span></span><code>    Error(Arc&lt;Error&gt;),\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
